            </note>
            <note corresp="#d55-f3" n="2" xml:id="d55-f3-content">
                <p>After making minor revisions, the President approved the draft and it was read by
                    Henderson at the opening session of the Council meeting in Karachi on January
                    26. For text, see <hi rendition="#italic">Public Papers of the Presidents of the
                        United States: Dwight D. Eisenhower, 1959</hi>, pp. 131–132.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
